`wrappingAdd` needs every operand of one type, got i32 and i64
`wrappingMul` takes i32 or i64 operands (convert with toI32 or toI64), got u32
`wrappingSub` takes i32 or i64 operands (convert with toI32 or toI64), got f64
`uncheckedGet` takes an array of numbers (i32, i64, u8, u16, u32, u64, f32 or f64), got string[]
`uncheckedGet` takes an array of numbers (i32, i64, u8, u16, u32, u64, f32 or f64), got i32
`uncheckedGet` expects an argument of type i32, got f64
Cannot `uncheckedSet` through readonly u8[] (declare it u8[] to write through it)
`uncheckedSet` expects an argument of type i32, got i64
